  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Riau Natural Gas Power Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project entails construction, operation and maintenance of a 275 megawatt (MW) combined-cycle gas-fired power plant (CCGT), located in Tenayan Raya District, Pekanbaru City Regency, Riau Province in the central part of Sumatra, and including a gas pipeline of approximately 40 km, a transmission line of approximately 750 m, and associated facilities.</narrative>
  </description>
